# Names of the dev secrets Project A needs. Copy to secrets/dev.env, fill in, then run
# `just secrets-init` to produce the encrypted secrets/dev.enc.env (the only form committed).
# Runtime secrets for tools never live here: they come from OpenBao at call time (Step 29).
